{"id":"c7de71d901","t":"My Possession Became a Ghost Story","c":"cv","n":43,"l":43,"s":["ml","az","az"],"k":{"ml":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story","az":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story"},"u":1795478041342,"desc":"وهكذا، فُتحت جنازتي من الآن فصاعدًا، واكتشفتُ منذ ذلك الحين رواية رومانسية مجهولة… وأكد أنه لم يتم اختيار رواية محددة. كان كليراني ويونداه في عجلة من أمرهما، لذلك قررتُ تغيير تركيزي والتخلص من هذه الغيمة. ومع ذلك، لم يتم حسم الأمر تمامًا لأنه لم يتم اختبار الرسوم المتحركة ولا التنانين، بل فُتحت أبواب جديدة! ومع ظهور قائد الفرسان الذي أدرك أنه البطل، بدأت أحداث غامضة تتكشف… فهل أنا الشرير، أم أن هناك سرًا في القصة لم يُكشف عنه بعد؟","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["خيال","دراما","رعب","رومانسى","غموض","فانتازيا","مانهوا"],"src":{"ml":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story","az":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/manga/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/1/","az":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/series/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/manga/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/2/","az":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/series/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/chapter-2"},"3":{"ml":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/manga/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/3/","az":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/series/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/chapter-3"},"4":{"ml":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/manga/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/4/","az":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/series/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/chapter-4"},"5":{"ml":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/manga/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/5/","az":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/series/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/chapter-5"},"6":{"ml":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/manga/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/6/","az":"my-possession-became-a-ghost-story|/series/my-possession-became-a-ghost-story/chapter-6"},"7":{"ml":"my-